@startuml
[*] --> LoggedIn

LoggedIn --> [*] : Logout
LoggedIn --> TrackingAttendance : Start Tracking
LoggedIn --> ViewingAttendance : View Attendance

TrackingAttendance --> [*] : Stop Tracking
TrackingAttendance --> TrackingAttendance : Continue Tracking
TrackingAttendance --> AwayFromWorkspace : Detect Away

AwayFromWorkspace --> LoggedIn : Notification Sent

ViewingAttendance --> LoggedIn : Back
@enduml
